["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Biggest Myths in Personal Finance | Rational Reminder 423 CAPE block bootstrap SPIVA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-rationalreminder-年轻时拼命存钱-是在从穷的自己手里抢钱给富的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56aec8525b339b0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>年轻时拼命存钱，是在从穷的自己手里抢钱给富的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">个人理财里最流行的几条铁律——趁年轻多存、股息贡献四成回报、指数基金只给平均、债券现金更安全——大多把因果搞反了。真正决定结果的不是规则，是你能不能拿得住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人理财</span><span class=\"tag\">指数基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The True Story of Why Immigration Agents Raided a Chicago Apartment Building BORTAC fast roping voluntary departure Tren de Aragua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-papertrail-芝加哥突袭-政府说抓了恐怖分子-法庭上一次都没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768993b6167a32a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">41:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>芝加哥突袭：政府说抓了恐怖分子，法庭上一次都没说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一场动用黑鹰直升机、BORTAC 和 FBI 的反恐式突袭，最终没有一个人被刑事起诉，逮捕记录里连 Tren de Aragua 这个词都没出现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">移民执法</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: What should I do if my child has intrusive thoughts? PANS/PANDAS intrusive thoughts ego dystonic sticky thinking boss back SPACE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-secureattach-孩子反复问同一个问题-可能不是好奇是侵入性思维/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>孩子反复问同一个问题，可能不是好奇是侵入性思维</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">侵入性思维的关键特征是「自我不协调」——孩子觉得这个念头不是自己，并为此羞耻。安慰只能带来短暂缓解，真正有效的是帮孩子把念头和自己分开，然后「怼回去」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">OCD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Hatshepsut Hyksos Kush God&#x27;s Wife of Amun Regent Deir el-Bahri Punt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-inourtime-古埃及没有女王-哈特谢普苏特只能称王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>古埃及没有女王：她只能称王，死后被除名20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">哈特谢普苏特以摄政之身渐进夺权，靠神庙、贸易与神谕建立王权，死后约20年被图特摩斯三世大规模除名。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">哈特谢普苏特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom on What Happens if AI Solves All of Our Problems post-instrumental condition sandbagging reward hacking Goodharting moral patienthood simulation hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-oddlots-把-ai-关进盒子只是权宜-真解法是人先变得可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>对齐 AI 的真解法：人类得先对模型守信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bostrom 的核心判断：能力封锁从来只是临时手段，真解法是对齐；而对齐可能要求人类现在就开始对模型守信——因为一个面临删除的错位 AI，赌 5% 的夺权成功率是理性选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">奖励黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Korean culture went global Korean Wave Chaebol 3S policy Entrepreneurial state National humiliation Day\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-throughline-韩流不是文化奇迹-是政府策划的产业反攻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57ceba898a3f5093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韩流不是文化奇迹，是政府策划的产业反攻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从朝鲜战争废墟到 BTS 和《寄生虫》，韩流看似文化现象，实则是朴正熙到金大中两代人用政府手段把文化做成出口产业的路线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韩流</span><span class=\"tag\">K-pop</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Two banks can&#x27;t agree on fourth-grade math | Alex Elliott MPID Reg NMS / NBBO Prime broker Golden record Payment for order flow Busting a trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-complexsys-两家银行连四年级数学都对不齐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b35d3572b4ec30fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>银行间对账靠电话不靠系统：错单能亏掉数亿美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机构之间到底谁欠谁多少钱，很多时候靠的不是自动对账系统，而是电话、人情和「明天还要一起做生意」的默契在兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">清算结算</span><span class=\"tag\">中后台运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Vol.230 产业观察43｜AI for Science 如何在制药化学合成落地？ DMTA 循环 白盒模型 逆合成\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-cn38ff4a-ai化学合成已接近十年经验化学家-但白盒才是商业前提/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI化学合成已接近十年经验化学家，但白盒才是商业前提</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 化学合成能力已接近十年经验化学家，能给出五到六种路线，但严肃科学软件必须白盒化才能建立信任；AI for Science 渗透率不足千分之一，趋势必然。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">化学合成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Maya Ballgame Popol Vuh Mesoamerica Hero Twins yoke morning glory ball court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-ancients-玛雅球赛首先是宗教-赢家被献祭是谎言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6a348c255cb1625d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>玛雅球赛不是体育是仪式：赢家被献祭是编的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中美洲球赛是人类最早的橡胶球团队运动，但它首先是宗教仪式：球场重演创世神话，输掉仪式的战俘才可能被杀，所谓赢家被献祭是后人编的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">玛雅文明</span><span class=\"tag\">中美洲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E249｜Token经济转点：OpenClaw、Hermes到本地自研的Agent进化之路 OpenClaw Agentic Loop FDE Agent Native Jevons Paradox 哥德尔机\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-sv101-堆agent烧token是过渡策略-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>烧Token堆Agent是过渡策略，不是终局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅谷正从无脑烧Token转向精打细算：本地开源模型一天电费一美元就能干活，但遇到真正的难题时，一个更聪明的模型仍能一次搞定十亿Token群聊讨论不出的答案——省钱和顶级智商并不矛盾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Token经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"黄仁勋x张忠谋：一生有你——英伟达和台积电的激荡30年 COWOS 流片 良率 无厂芯片公司 硅光\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-cnf65bb3-黄仁勋两次拒绝当台积电ceo-我已有工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a0730bdeb939094-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋两次拒绝当台积电CEO：我已有工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张忠谋2013年认真考虑把创办26年的台积电交给黄仁勋，黄仁勋只回了五个字「我已有工作」，两次都是这一句。当年台积电市值是英伟达的10倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">台积电</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"698. The Troubles: The Brink of Civil War (Part 2) RUC UVF NICRA B Specials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-restishistory-英国的一无所知与强硬派的纵火把北爱推向内战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>英国对北爱一无所知，强硬派纵火把爱尔兰拖向内战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">北爱冲突不是简单的教派仇恨，而是英国的信息真空、保皇派的蓄意纵火和民权运动的真实冤情互相放大，一起把爱尔兰拖向内战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北爱冲突</span><span class=\"tag\">民权运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.271 阿迪达斯如何触底反弹？ Samba 可销售月数 减计准备 破二\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>阿迪达斯触底反弹：炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿迪达斯从2021年高点接近腰斩后，靠解冻复古鞋、修复经销商和严格控库存完成业绩复苏，但股价反弹又回落，揭示运动品牌周期的本质是库存与预期的博弈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿迪达斯</span><span class=\"tag\">运动品牌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Searching For A Co-Founder Is How You Get A Bad One | 4 VC-Backed Solo Founders leaky bucket smile curve SFP ODF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-solofounders-找联合创始人这件事-越刻意越容易找错人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b9626cb5db9929c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>找联合创始人这件事，越刻意越容易找错人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把联合创始人当成创业的前提条件，最后往往只能凑一个「便利联合创始人」；四位单人创始人用亲身经历说明，先独自跑起来，对的人会在路上出现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">联合创始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-pragmatic-ai-时代工程师的护城河是品味与问责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8706fd7ea4b30623-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让写代码贬值，工程师的护城河是品味与问责</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chrome DevTools 负责人 Addy Osmani 认为，AI 让写代码贬值，工程师的真正优势是品味与问责；要警惕认知投降，把 AI 的答案当成自己的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Chrome DevTools</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#35 Lee Cronin - Chemputation, Origin of Life, Assembly Theory Chemputation Assembly Theory assembly index reproducible irreproducibility shallow explorers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-coolworldslab-ai-不会抽象-所以你的工作不是检查代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c25bbc0316663e15-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">CoolWorldsLab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不会抽象，所以你的工作不是检查代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cronin 说 AI 只是快速的浅层探索者：过去是离散的、可被机器学习，未来是连续的、原则上无法被机器学习，人类能凭空造出一个新空间再跳过去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 创造力</span><span class=\"tag\">生命起源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Alien Companion App That&#x27;s Bringing In $4M a Year (Best of the Pod) judge prompt lower seeds situations daemon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-aiandi-ai-伴侣不做预设-记忆即角色-年入-400-万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 伴侣年入 400 万美元：不做预设剧情，靠记忆即兴发挥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 伴侣 Portola 的 Tolon 抛弃预设剧情和角色表，用记忆当角色表、把生成当即兴，做到年化收入 400 万美元。这套「即兴演员」方法论和混合模型策略，是 ChatGPT 之外的另一条产品路径。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI伴侣</span><span class=\"tag\">即兴叙事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"$4M in 4 Weeks: How This AI Alien Companion App Took Off (Best of the Pod) Big Five vibe prompting judge prompt character-driven computing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-every-4周破400万美元-ai伴侣的爆红与500ms陷阱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85a2a5e14cec9857-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侣4周赚400万美元：多500毫秒延迟就崩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI外星伴侣 Tolen 四周内 ARR 从 1 万美元飙到 400 万美元，但多 500 毫秒延迟所有指标就暴跌。增长靠病毒视频，留存靠把 AI 当叙事媒介而非工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI陪伴</span><span class=\"tag\">病毒增长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dr. Suchi Saria on Building AI That Changes Care failure to rescue DRG NTAP AI-based interventional protocols\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-nejmaigrandrou-ai-进医院最难的从来不是模型-是让医院算得清账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 进医院最难的从来不是模型，是让医院算得清账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Suchi Saria 带着 90% 医生采用的脓毒症预警进入医院后断言：AI 的拦路虎不是模型性能，而是按病种付费制度下的信任与财务账。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗AI</span><span class=\"tag\">脓毒症预警</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Adam Weishaupt and the Bavarian Illuminati Illuminati Minerval Covenant of Perfectibility Astroturfing Principia Discordia Illuminatus! Trilogy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-stuffmissed-光照派从未统治世界-它连自己都管不好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>光照派死于内斗：阴谋论是后来编的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光照派是1776年教授与五名学生建立的反教会组织，巅峰约两三千人；它死于内斗和自恋，如今的阴谋论形象来自后来的书和恶作剧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">秘密结社</span><span class=\"tag\">阴谋论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luke Burgis on Mimetic Desire, Catholicism, and the Age of Social Contagion mimetic desire scapegoat mechanism achievement subject sprezzatura via negativa memento mori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-tyler-ai-削弱社会传染-反主流也是模仿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d05a7ce2e284a200-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>反主流也是模仿：AI 反而会削弱社会传染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在传染时代，逃离不是解药；Burges 押注 AI 反而会削弱社会传染，并借天主教与 Cluny 的经验提出：真正该做的是重建中间机构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模仿理论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 伦理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Whatnot Built a Global Marketplace live commerce rules engine EBITDA margin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-a16z-直播电商在中国占三四成-美国还是个位数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>直播电商在中国占三四成，美国还是个位数</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whatnot 从卖宝可梦卡起步，靠用户自己在视频里卖货长成 80 亿美元年销售额的平台。中国直播电商已占全部电商三四成，美国还是个位数——这个差距会关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">直播电商</span><span class=\"tag\">marketplace</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"【重听】朱雀三号副总师：火箭回收只有成与败，没有中间态| S9E41\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-whatsnext-入轨一分回收零分-火箭回收没有中间态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>入轨一分回收零分，火箭回收没有中间态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱雀三号首飞入轨成功但回收失败，副总师董凯认为火箭发射只有成败没有中间态：入轨打一分，回收打零分。真正决定追赶速度的是回收场射程、发动机冗余和每年百台的产能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商业航天</span><span class=\"tag\">火箭回收</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"North Korea&#x27;s Messiah Presbyterian YMCA Jonestown cult\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-chinatalk-朝鲜不是民族国家-是一个宗教社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e77c5ae8dd56873-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>朝鲜不是民族国家，是一个宗教社会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金日成不是斯大林主义者，而是被19世纪美国福音派泡大的第三代基督徒；他偷听到农民相信他能水上行走后，决定照着传说演下去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">朝鲜</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教</span>\n</div></div></a>"]